    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d271">

                <pb facs="0238" n="228" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg228"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4–549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-05">April 5,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received April 4—10:46 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>699. North Shensi broadcast April 1 announces appointment Nieh Jung-chen sixth
                    Communist peace delegate and Chi Yi-ming Secretary General Communist
                    delegation.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 699, repeated Shanghai 327, OffEmb Canton unnumbered.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
